§ `s 105(4) SSAA 115B(4) and (4A); s 105(7) SSA1998 Sch 3 paras 6A and 6B`

#ASSERT `s 105(4) SSAA 115B(4)(b) criminal proceedings may be instituted against the recipient for the conduct` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 105(4) SSAA 115B(4)(b) criminal proceedings may be instituted against the recipient for the conduct` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 105(4) SSAA 115B(4)(a) the penalty is recoverable from the recipient` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 105(4) SSAA 115B(4)(a) the penalty is recoverable from the recipient` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
