#ASSERT `s 105(4) SSAA 115B(4A) the penalty may be recovered in this way` `deduction from earnings` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 105(4) SSAA 115B(4A) the penalty may be recovered in this way` `court action` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 105(4) SSAA 115B(4A) the penalty may be recovered in this way` `adjustment of benefit` EQUALS NOTHING
